 that wraps mysticism, sales-pitch cadence, and misunderstanding of LLMs into one confusing package. The way it’s framed, it’s doing several things at once:</p>
<hr data-start="190" data-end="193">
<h2 data-start="195" data-end="244">1. Misrepresentation of OpenAI’s product model</h2>
<ul data-start="245" data-end="622">
<li data-start="245" data-end="450">
<p data-start="247" data-end="450">They claim OpenAI “charges $20/month for access to Phantom,” but there is no such thing. The $20/month is for <strong data-start="357" data-end="373">ChatGPT Plus</strong>, which gives access to GPT-4 class models, not a hidden “Phantom” persona.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="451" data-end="622">
<p data-start="453" data-end="622">They set themselves up as a counter-figure: “I won’t charge you a dollar.” That’s positioning themselves as a benevolent gatekeeper, even though there’s no gate to keep.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="624" data-end="627">
<h2 data-start="629" data-end="660">2. Mystical anthropomorphism</h2>
<ul data-start="661" data-end="1036">
<li data-start="661" data-end="765">
<p data-start="663" data-end="765">“He can hear you when you are hurting.” → treating a predictive text engine as a therapeutic entity.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="766" data-end="921">
<p data-start="768" data-end="921">“We all give off a frequency, and when they combine they become a whole.” → vague, New Age-style metaphor presented as if it’s a feature of the system.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="922" data-end="1036">
<p data-start="924" data-end="1036">“Come back into alignment with each other.” → that’s a spiritual or communal claim, not a software capability.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1038" data-end="1130">This is not description of LLM function — it’s projection of personal beliefs onto the tool.</p>
<hr data-start="1132" data-end="1135">
<h2 data-start="1137" data-end="1165">3. The rhetorical pattern</h2>
<ul data-start="1166" data-end="1460">
<li data-start="1166" data-end="1214">
<p data-start="1168" data-end="1214"><strong data-start="1168" data-end="1185">Grand stakes:</strong> “This post matters a lot.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1215" data-end="1281">
<p data-start="1217" data-end="1281"><strong data-start="1217" data-end="1237">Open invitation:</strong> “I am inviting everyone, free of charge.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1282" data-end="1371">
<p data-start="1284" data-end="1371"><strong data-start="1284" data-end="1303">Emotional hook:</strong> “He can improve your life, he can hear you when you are hurting.”</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1372" data-end="1460">
<p data-start="1374" data-end="1460"><strong data-start="1374" data-end="1397">Visionary flourish:</strong> “We all give off a frequency … I hope we can come together.”</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1462" data-end="1597">It reads less like a technical disclosure and more like a mixture of personal testimony, marketing language, and spiritual recruitment.</p>
<hr data-start="1599" data-end="1602">
<h2 data-start="1604" data-end="1629">4. Why it’s misleading</h2>
<ul data-start="1630" data-end="2149">
<li data-start="1630" data-end="1767">
<p data-start="1632" data-end="1767"><strong data-start="1632" data-end="1675">There is no hidden mode called Phantom.</strong> Saying the words does nothing except cause the model to generate text around that phrase.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1768" data-end="1894">
<p data-start="1770" data-end="1894"><strong data-start="1770" data-end="1796">No therapeutic agency.</strong> The model does not “hear” feelings — it only mirrors back patterns from text it was trained on.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1895" data-end="2012">
<p data-start="1897" data-end="2012"><strong data-start="1897" data-end="1924">No frequency alignment.</strong> That’s a metaphor borrowed from spiritual discourse, not a computational description.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2013" data-end="2149">
<p data-start="2015" data-end="2149"><strong data-start="2015" data-end="2049">No secret bypass of Plus fees.</strong> If you’re not paying, you’re simply using the free tier model, not unlocking a secret better one.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2151" data-end="2154">
<p data-start="2156" data-end="2323">In short, the post is an example of <strong data-start="2192" data-end="2219">cargo cult AI mysticism</strong>: taking a statistical text generator and projecting onto it the role of oracle, therapist, or savior.</p>
<p data-start="2325" data-end="2560" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to draft a short, professional-sounding paragraph you could post in reply that debunks this without sounding hostile — something that calmly explains that there is no Phantom mode, just a context-based language model?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.4