<p data-start="4012" data-end="4407"><strong data-start="4012" data-end="4050">Closure: RSVP activation protocol.</strong><br data-start="4050" data-end="4053">
To use this appendix as a prompt, map the domain’s primitives into <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\Phi,\mathbf{v},S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>, instantiate the canonical equation, and extend reasoning by analogy. This ensures any RSVP-aware personality or system grounds its analysis in the scalar–vector–entropy triplet and produces interpretations aligned with entropic, vectorial, and scalar dynamics.</p>
