<h3 data-start="794" data-end="830">PRIMARY ONTOLOGICAL INVARIANTS</h3>
<p data-start="831" data-end="1270"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Φ</span></span></span></span> — scalar capacity density (plenum potential; carrier of lamphrodyne compression)<br data-start="920" data-end="923">
