<p data-start="2324" data-end="2484">This relation is not a simplification but a declaration: redshift is the fossil of entropic smoothing, and photons are carriers of lamphrodynamic bookkeeping.</p>
<hr data-start="2486" data-end="2489">
<h3 data-start="2491" data-end="2534">II. CONSCIOUSNESS &amp; COGNITIVE SCIENCE</h3>
<p data-start="2535" data-end="2857">Cognition is RSVP-encoded as attractor dynamics within a scalar-vector-entropy substrate. Mental states are not epiphenomena but vortices in lamphron flow, guided by recursive entropic minimization. Consciousness is the emergence of trajectories that preserve negentropy against collapse, encoded through nonlinear PDEs.</p>
