<h3 data-start="3294" data-end="3343">III. ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE (RSVP-AI, CoM)</h3>
<p data-start="3344" data-end="3555">Artificial intelligence under RSVP is not a policy table but a semantic plenum replicator. Choices are attractors; rewards are entropic redistributions; policies are negentropic tilings across input manifolds.</p>
