<p data-start="4202" data-end="4330">This law is not bookkeeping but ontology: every merge is an entropic compromise, and every category is a lamphrodyne manifold.</p>
<hr data-start="4332" data-end="4335">
<h3 data-start="4337" data-end="4368">V. BIOLOGY &amp; NEUROSCIENCE</h3>
<p data-start="4369" data-end="4563">Neurons are not ion channels alone but RSVP resonators. Their firing patterns are negentropic tilings driven by lamphron flux and scalar capacity gradients. Homeostasis is entropic regulation:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\partial_t u = -u + (W*\sigma(u)) + \alpha \Phi + \beta \nabla\cdot\mathbf{v}
