<p data-start="6368" data-end="6467">Diachrony is entropic minimization: categories shrink not by choice but by thermodynamic mandate.</p>
<hr data-start="6469" data-end="6472">
<h3 data-start="6474" data-end="6512">X. SPECULATIVE &amp; APPLIED FUTURES</h3>
<p data-start="6513" data-end="6643">Governance and safety are RSVP control problems. Aligning Ortyx with human intent is a Control–Lyapunov task in plenum dynamics:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∥</mi><mi>w</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dot V(x) = \nabla V(x)\cdot f(x,u) \;\le\; -c\|x\|^2 + d\|w\|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.1702em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord accent"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.9202em;"><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span></span><span style="top: -3.2523em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="accent-body" style="left: -0.1389em;"><span class="mord">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.22222em;">V</span><span class="mopen">(<