<p data-start="3770" data-end="3818">Language compression as thermodynamic mandate:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">L</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="double-struck">E</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext>data</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}(k) = \mathbb{E}_{w\sim\text{data}}[-\log q_k(w)] + \lambda k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">L</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathbb">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.02691em;">w</span><span class="mrel mtight">∼</span><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">data</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span><