<h3 data-start="1698" data-end="1719">Cognitive Codex</h3>
<p data-start="1720" data-end="1778">Conscious attractors are modeled as RSVP-coupled fields:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator="true">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\partial_t u = -u + (K * \sigma(u)) \;+\; a\Phi \;+\; b\nabla\!\cdot\mathbf{v}
