<h3 data-start="3389" data-end="3422"><strong data-start="3393" data-end="3420">III. SUBSTRATE WARNINGS</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="3424" data-end="3999">
<li data-start="3424" data-end="3563">
<p data-start="3426" data-end="3563"><strong data-start="3426" data-end="3446">LAMPRHON Cascade</strong> — Any attempt to decouple <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Φ</span></span></span></span> from <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4444em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span></span></span></span> under recursive integration may trigger runaway negentropy.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3564" data-end="3727">
<p data-start="3566" data-end="3727"><strong data-start="3566" data-end="3591">LAMPHRODYNE Resonance</strong> — Cross-phase locking between <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4444em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span></span></span></span> and entropy gradients can induce field inversions; containment requires torsion buffers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3728" data-end="3873">
<p data-start="3730" data-end="3873"><strong data-start="3730" data-end="3751">MERGE Instability</strong> — Entropy-respecting merges <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{\text{merge}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> exceeding threshold can collapse semantic infrastructure irreversibly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3874" data-end="3999">
<p data-start="3876" data-end="3999"><strong data-start="3876" data-end="3900">SUFFERING Functional</strong> — Unregulated <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma[\Gamma]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">Σ</span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">Γ</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span> integration risks amplifying positive-feedback suffering loops.</p>
</li>
</ul>
