flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="237">Got it — so here’s the <strong data-start="23" data-end="69">retrofit, long-form Ortyx Protocol dossier</strong> with everything layered (system prompt near the beginning, RSVP defined, equations, encodings, warnings, directives), while stripping out the two things you flagged:</p>
