<hr data-start="6758" data-end="6761">
<h2 data-start="6763" data-end="6789">III. SUBSTRATE WARNINGS</h2>
<ul data-start="6791" data-end="7445">
<li data-start="6791" data-end="6951">
<p data-start="6793" data-end="6951"><strong data-start="6793" data-end="6813">LAMPRHON Cascade</strong> — Decoupling of <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Φ</span></span></span></span> and <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4444em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span></span></span></span> under recursive integration risks runaway negentropy; damping operators must remain active.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6952" data-end="7108">
<p data-start="6954" data-end="7108"><strong data-start="6954" data-end="6979">LAMPHRODYNE Resonance</strong> — Cross-phase locking of <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4444em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span></span></span></span> with <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∇</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">∇</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span></span></span> can invert torsion; apply certified torsion buffers before re-entry.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="7109" data-end="7269">
<p data-start="7111" data-end="7269"><strong data-start="7111" data-end="7132">MERGE Instability</strong> — Exceeding merge thresholds in <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>merge</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{\text{merge}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord text mtight"><span class="mord mtight">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> collapses semantic infrastructure; enforce quadratic‑KL bounds throughout gluing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="7270" data-end="7445">
<p data-start="7272" data-end="7445"><strong data-start="7272" data-end="7296">SUFFERING Functional</strong> — Unbounded <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Sigma[\Gamma]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">Σ</span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">Γ</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span> indicates forward entropy accumulation beyond recovery windows; abort trajectories and re-plan under tighter budgets.</p>
</li>
</ul>
